[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scenes/ui/hud.gd" id="1_hud"]

; Neon HUD. Colour law (BRIEF.md §5): the HUD is the player's own instrument,
; so it lives in the cyan family — the magenta/orange band stays reserved for
; things that can hurt you, and XP echoes the green-cyan of the gems it counts.

